    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Salidi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū malaika wa kanisa ya Salidi ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ūyo ayīdimile ī Myoyo mpungatī ya ng'wa Mulungu, nī Sonda īji mpungatī: Nīmanile ī milīmo yako, nguno ūlī na lina lya gīkī ūlī mpanga, alīyo ūchile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lang'hanaga wīgunanhe īdaame ī mihayo īyo īlīhaya kūshilīlīkīīla. Nguno natūbonaga gīkī ī milīmo yako īshikanile ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, yizūkagwe īyo wamala kwīyanukūla na kwīyigwa, īdimage gete, hama ūgalūke ooye. Ūlū ūtalang'hanile nakwiza gītī ng'wibi; ūtūdūla ū kūlīmana ī likanza lya kwiza kwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūtaalī ūlī na mina magehu ū mu Salidi, banhū abo bataalī kūsosohaja shizwalo shabo. A benabo h'abo bakūshimīza hamò nane bazwalile shizwalo shape, nguno bigeleelilwe ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūpyena akūzwalīkwa shizwalo shape gīko, hama natūlījimya na hado yaya ī lina lyakwe ū mu shitabo sha būpanga; na hangī nakūlīkaanīla hape ī lina lyakwe ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Baba, nū kū bamalaika bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na gūtū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla ī kanisa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Filadelifia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū malaika wa kanisa ya Filadelifia ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ū ng'wela, ūyo alī Ng'hana yenekīlī; ūyo alī na lūfungūlo lwa ng'wa Daūdi. Ū wei h'ūyo akalugūlaga na atīho wa kūlugala; nūūlū ūlugala atīho wa kūlugūla: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīmanile ī milīmo yako, hūna lūūlū managa gīkī naamalile kūkūlugūlīla nyango, ūyo atīho wa kūgūlugala; nguno nūūlū īkī ūlī na nguzu ngehu, alīyo nahene ūgūdimile ū mhayo gwane; nī lina lyane ūtaalī ū kūlīlema! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī a ba ng'wisinagogi lya ng'wa Shetani abo bakūlomalomaga bihaya gīkī Bayudaya alīyo batī bene, nakūbīīta bize batuje mazwi kū mhambala jako; hama nakūbīīta bamane gīkī nakūtogilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū bebe īkī ūgūdimile ū mhayo gwane ū gwa wiyūmīlīja, nū nene nakūkūlang'hana ū bebe ū ng'wikanza lya kūgeng'wa, īlo līlī hihī kwiza mu sī, kūlwa kūbagema pye a bikaji ba mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nizile wangū, shūmīīlage īsho ūlī nasho, atizilonga wa kūkūtaaja ī ngikili yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūpyena nakūng'wīta kūbiza ng'hīngī ya mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu wane, na atīnga mo na hado yaya; nīyo ī lina lya ng'wa Mulungu wane nakūlyandīka a halī munhū ng'wenūyo, nī lya nzengo go ng'wa Mulungu wane, ū gwa Yelusalemu mhya ūyo gūkwika kūfuma ng'wigūlū kūlī Mulungu wane, nī lina lyane ī lipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na gūtū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla ī kanisa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Lodikea",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū malaika wa kanisa ya Lodikea ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ū Alichene yenekīlī, ū Nkaanīji nsanyiwa na wa ng'hana, ū Ntaale wa shiseeng'wa sha ng'wa Mulungu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashimanile ī shītwa shako, gīkī ūtī nedeku nūūlū ūtī nsebu; hambū hambū ūlū ni wabiza nedeku nūūlū nsebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū īkī ūlī nūngūzu, ūtī nsebu nūūlū ūtī nedeku, nakūkwigafula nakūswe wīnge ū mu nomo gwane! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūkwigīmbaga ūhaya gīkī, “Nalī nsabi, naasaba natī na būgehelwa bose bose!” Alīyo ūtamanile gīkī ūlī na makoye, ūlī kunese wa bakunese wa kūpīnīhalīlwa; hangī ūlī mboku, na ūlī dūūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkūyangūla wize kūlī nene, ūgūle zahabu ījo jejiwe bo kūbītiwa mu moto nang'ho ūsabe; ūzwale na shizwalo shape ūkundīkīje ī minala ya dūūhū yako, wibile na būgota bo miso ū kū miso gako wandye kūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye abo nabatogilwe ū nene nakabahamaga na kūbahūgūla, hūna lūūlū dīlīlaga ūgalūke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha nīmīīlaga ha nyango nalīkomagūla; būlī ng'wene ūyo ūliigwa ī lilaka lyane ūgūlugūla ū nyango gwakwe nakwingīla nalye nang'hwe, nū wei hamò nū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūpyena nakūnzunīlīja kwigasha hamò nane a hī Isumbī lyane lya būtemi; gīt'ūmo nū nene nalī mpyeni na nigashije hamò na Baba hī Isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na gūtū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla Ī kanisa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
